note right of Done
  Current state after stage 11:

  - Stages 01-11 are implemented enough for the current shop flow.
  - Database.puml is represented by entities/migrations for the
    current sales, purchase, payment, inventory and production model.
  - Remaining work is not a return to earlier stages.
    It is a forward cleanup layer that closes admin UI,
    lifecycle policy, workflow drift and advanced inventory gaps.
end note

